plugin-qualify (0.17.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release PR plugin-qualify 0.17.2
  * The sync removes the records of an installed plugin's other bytes,
    referenced or not (#198)
  * Test that the descriptor writer's timeout is per plugin (#202)
  * Test that files holding the same CLAP id stay separate targets (#202)
  * Pin each CLAP file under its own key; descriptor writes get a timeout per
    plugin (#202)
  * The sweep test runs the fast grid: it tests the budget of a hung plugin,
    not the grid (#212)
  * The default grid is the full one: every rate times every block size (#212)

